            {
                "entry_id": "6e91df98-7bf4-34bb-9ca9-0175e0ecab2d",
                "word": "lumpenprolétariat",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c003a161-70c8-4e1f-a665-1c903303189e",
                        "entry_id": "6e91df98-7bf4-34bb-9ca9-0175e0ecab2d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lumpenprolétariats"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9554080-3e8f-3c14-be0b-690e7dc5337a",
                        "entry_id": "6e91df98-7bf4-34bb-9ca9-0175e0ecab2d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pour les marxistes, frange du prolétariat trop misérable pour acquérir une conscience de classe et se rallier à la révolution prolétarienne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Marxism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4d90300-5605-4242-8711-3de4c123df04",
                                "sense_id": "c9554080-3e8f-3c14-be0b-690e7dc5337a",
                                "text": "Vous appartenez au Lumpenprolétariat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10a49a59-c490-49a1-a8d7-60058f495346",
                                "sense_id": "c9554080-3e8f-3c14-be0b-690e7dc5337a",
                                "text": "Le cannabisme a créé un lumpenprolétariat de la bicrave, une nouvelle classe de travailleurs exploités par un modèle économique ultralibéral, voire barbare, qui assujettit dès le plus jeune âge frères, camarades et amis à un climat concurrentiel violent et dérégulé."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eacceec2-0232-4189-bac4-75ac63b9e662",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e91df98-7bf4-34bb-9ca9-0175e0ecab2d",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9554080-3e8f-3c14-be0b-690e7dc5337a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Lumpenproletariat",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Lumpenproletariat",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f17fe1dc-c170-301e-be1e-0fdf8c0911be",
                                        "entry_id": "7687741a-2512-3dbc-b7da-ededc08567b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "„unterste Gesellschaftsschicht ohne Klassenbewusstsein“"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dab3171-069b-443a-a9d3-7d07a5376f1f",
                                                "sense_id": "f17fe1dc-c170-301e-be1e-0fdf8c0911be",
                                                "text": "„Die Schwienteks, die Choloneks und ihre Nachbarn sind ein grotesk beschriebenes Lumpenproletariat, gerne mit Ambitionen in Richtung Bürgerlichkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6362403e-1d21-40e3-9300-2a3e87ed5bed",
                                                "sense_id": "f17fe1dc-c170-301e-be1e-0fdf8c0911be",
                                                "text": "„An vielen Orten hielt sich die eingesessene tschechische Bevölkerung – das Lumpenproletariat, das es in allen Städten von einer bestimmten Größe an gibt, vielleicht ausgenommen – bei Brutalitäten gegenüber den eingesessenen Deutschen zurück.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08a1ff52-55d7-4782-86e0-f74a41c4cfbe",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e91df98-7bf4-34bb-9ca9-0175e0ecab2d",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9554080-3e8f-3c14-be0b-690e7dc5337a",
                        "target_lang_word": "lumpenproletariat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lumpenproletariat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b41b9aa5-215a-37e8-8edd-f3231ee734df",
                                        "entry_id": "3f1be38c-f37b-3f05-a5d6-54c334e6b716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lowest stratum of the proletariat, whose mental and physical health, mores and morale have deteriorated, through exploitation by the bourgeoisie, to a degree where they cannot build class consciousness and hence cannot be mobilized for the revolution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Marxism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c327114-2052-40d8-9ec1-8b229b9910b7",
                                                "sense_id": "b41b9aa5-215a-37e8-8edd-f3231ee734df",
                                                "text": "I hadn't quite figured her out yet: rude snob or lumpenproletariat?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02111656-847e-3cbc-840c-a59c4a48b388",
                                        "entry_id": "3f1be38c-f37b-3f05-a5d6-54c334e6b716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A social underclass; the riffraff."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
